  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(a) Dimensions of quantity are given bellow</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Wb</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now the dimension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msqrt><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></msqrt></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(b) The dimension of electric and magnetic field is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Wb</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now the dimension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(c) The dimension of capacitance&nbsp;and resistance is given by,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now the dimension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>l</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>All quantities are having the dimensions of velocity.</p>"
